    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_02",
      "hash64": "96408B3C202A58DF",
      "text": "¿Has venido a la sala de profesores ex profeso\\npara verme, valga la redundancia?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_select_01",
      "hash64": "5CD5EE18BF0E6821",
      "text": "¡Así es!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_select_02",
      "hash64": "5CD5EB18BF0E6308",
      "text": "¿Ex profeso?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_03",
      "hash64": "96408A3C202A572C",
      "text": "¡Ja, ja, ja! ¡Parece que por fin he logrado\\nganarme el corazón de algunos de vosotros!\\c\\n¡Qué alegría! That makes me very happy![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_04",
      "hash64": "9640893C202A5579",
      "text": "La principal idea que intento transmitir en mis\\nclases es que la comunicación es muy importante.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_05",
      "hash64": "9640883C202A53C6",
      "text": "Quiero que sepáis que me tenéis aquí para\\ncualquier cosa.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_06",
      "hash64": "9640873C202A5213",
      "text": "Ya sean dudas que os surjan en clase o cualquier\\nproblemilla que tengáis en la academia. Tell me![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_language_a_system_01",
      "hash64": "FB2A930FF223C7E6",
      "text": "¡Ahora te llevas un poco mejor con Silvio!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
